{"id":"f313c6ed0d590fe2","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-SubsystemInclusion.md","title":"Strict Big Five Inclusion Chain","display":"thm-SubsystemInclusion — Strict Big Five Inclusion Chain","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-SubsystemInclusion","aliases":["62-thm-SubsystemInclusion"],"display":"thm-SubsystemInclusion — Strict Big Five Inclusion Chain","depends_on":["[[62-thm-RCA0-WKL-proper]]","[[62-thm-WKL-ACA-proper]]","[[62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper]]","[[62-thm-ATR-Pi1-CA-proper]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remarks I.10.2, I.11.4","source_pages":[36,40],"source_pdf_pages":[54,58]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-SubsystemInclusion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-SubsystemInclusion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-SubsystemInclusion — Strict Big Five Inclusion Chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3775efe260e41ceb\" href=\"?note=3775efe260e41ceb\" title=\"62-thm-RCA0-WKL-proper\">62-thm-RCA0-WKL-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c183c4f51ea1c088\" href=\"?note=c183c4f51ea1c088\" title=\"62-thm-WKL-ACA-proper\">62-thm-WKL-ACA-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66d09cd516d4b5e1\" href=\"?note=66d09cd516d4b5e1\" title=\"62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper\">62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a759143ad2dba1b\" href=\"?note=9a759143ad2dba1b\" title=\"62-thm-ATR-Pi1-CA-proper\">62-thm-ATR-Pi1-CA-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remarks I.10.2, I.11.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>36</span><span>40</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>54</span><span>58</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>四段理论严格包含见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3775efe260e41ceb\" href=\"?note=3775efe260e41ceb\" title=\"62-thm-RCA0-WKL-proper\">62-thm-RCA0-WKL-proper</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c183c4f51ea1c088\" href=\"?note=c183c4f51ea1c088\" title=\"62-thm-WKL-ACA-proper\">62-thm-WKL-ACA-proper</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"66d09cd516d4b5e1\" href=\"?note=66d09cd516d4b5e1\" title=\"62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper\">62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9a759143ad2dba1b\" href=\"?note=9a759143ad2dba1b\" title=\"62-thm-ATR-Pi1-CA-proper\">62-thm-ATR-Pi1-CA-proper</a>，它们携带各理论接口；Cn 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0\\)</span> 按这些接口解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}SubsystemInclusion}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{RCA}_0)\\subsetneq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0)\\subsetneq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0)\\subsetneq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0)\\subsetneq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}SubsystemInclusion}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{RCA}_0)\\subsetneq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0)\\subsetneq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0)\\subsetneq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0)\\subsetneq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由四个独立分离结果合成，严格性落在演绎闭包上；书中不同形式的公理表不必逐项字面嵌套。每段均有来源和反模型依据，不能只靠系统定义推出严格性。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Remarks I.10.2, I.11.4；纸面页 36, 40；PDF 页 54, 58。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-thm-RCA0-WKL-proper","status":"resolved","id":"3775efe260e41ceb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-RCA0-WKL-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-WKL-ACA-proper","status":"resolved","id":"c183c4f51ea1c088","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-WKL-ACA-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper","status":"resolved","id":"66d09cd516d4b5e1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-ATR-Pi1-CA-proper","status":"resolved","id":"9a759143ad2dba1b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-ATR-Pi1-CA-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-RCA0-WKL-proper","status":"resolved","id":"3775efe260e41ceb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hy